  "description": {
   "en": "Former Olympic candidate Kaneda Musashi has been appointed coach of the women's track and field club at Tsukimi University.  \nMeanwhile, Misaki Tono, the 100 meters ace there, is in a slump because she can't sprint due to her chest being too big…!  \nWith a competition agaisnt a rival college just around the corner, can Musashi, a virgin track and field head win the hearts of the female collage students!?",
   "ja": "元オリンピック候補選手の金田武蔵は、月見大学女子陸上部のコーチに就任。そこの100mのエース・遠野美咲は、大きすぎる胸のせいで全力疾走できず極度のスランプに陥っていた…！ライバル校との対抗戦を間近に控え、陸上一筋の童貞男・武蔵は、女子大生たちの心を掴むことができるのか――!?"
  },
